<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Job Apply Details - SASIKUMAR AI</title>
<style>
body{font-family:Arial;margin:0;background:#f5f5f5;color:#222}
header{background:#111;color:#fff;padding:20px;text-align:center}
main{max-width:700px;margin:auto;padding:16px}
.card{background:#fff;padding:18px;margin:14px 0;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px #ccc}
li{margin:10px 0}
</style>
<style id="sasikumar-job-apply-3d">
body{
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 8% 18%,rgba(0,190,255,.25),transparent 30%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 92% 22%,rgba(255,0,180,.22),transparent 30%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 50% 90%,rgba(255,190,0,.22),transparent 34%),
    linear-gradient(135deg,#eef8ff,#fff3fb,#fffbea);
  background-size:180% 180%;
  animation:applyBg 12s ease infinite;
}
@keyframes applyBg{
  0%,100%{background-position:0% 50%}
  50%{background-position:100% 50%}
}
.card{
  position:relative;
  overflow:hidden;
  border-radius:22px!important;
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.75)!important;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.72)!important;
  backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
  box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(30,60,120,.16),
             inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.85);
  transition:transform .3s ease,box-shadow .3s ease;
}
.card::after{
  content:"";
  position:absolute;
  width:130px;height:130px;
  right:-65px;top:-65px;
  border-radius:50%;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#00c6ff,#ff3cac);
  opacity:.16;
  pointer-events:none;
}
.card:hover{
  transform:translateY(-7px) rotateX(2deg) scale(1.01);
  box-shadow:0 24px 48px rgba(30,60,120,.24);
}
h1,h2{
  background:linear-gradient(90deg,#0066ff,#a000ff,#ff1493,#ff9800);
  background-size:250% auto;
  -webkit-background-clip:text;
  background-clip:text;
  color:transparent;
  animation:applyTitle 5s linear infinite;
}
@keyframes applyTitle{
  to{background-position:250% center}
}
li{
  margin-bottom:8px;
  line-height:1.5;
}
a{
  transition:transform .2s ease,letter-spacing .2s ease;
}
a:hover{
  letter-spacing:.3px;
}
@media(max-width:600px){
  .card{border-radius:18px!important}
}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  *,*::before,*::after{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}
}
</style>

</head>
<body>
<header><h1>📝 Job Apply Details</h1><p>SASIKUMAR AI</p></header>
<main>
<div class="card">
<h2>📋 Before Applying</h2>
<ul>
<li>Job Title and Department</li>
<li>Educational Qualification</li>
<li>Age and Eligibility</li>
<li>Vacancies</li>
<li>Salary / Pay Level</li>
<li>Application Start Date</li>
<li>Last Date</li>
<li>Required Documents</li>
<li>Application Fee, if applicable</li>
<li>Official Application Link</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h2>⚠️ Important</h2>
<p>Verify every vacancy from the official recruitment notification before applying. SASIKUMAR AI does not guarantee selection, employment or the authenticity of employer-submitted information.</p>
</div>
</main>
</body></html>
